        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Internet Use in Taiwan: 1998&ndash;2000</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H8UCdndV8oft6MxU586lNWylgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Internet Use in Taiwan: 1998&ndash;2000 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về phần trăm người d&ugrave;ng Internet ở Đ&agrave;i Loan theo độ tuổi từ năm 1998 đến năm 2000</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeGddQI7qocDTdxpNkClZpiTgMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></strong></a> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction </strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XoPtdUMPzo2eYDxXGUKlO6v6g0r\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Internet Use in Taiwan: 1998&ndash;2000 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm người d&ugrave;ng Internet - theo độ tuổi - Đ&agrave;i Loan -giai đoạn 3 năm từ năm 1998 đến 2000.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XoPtdUMPzo2eYDxXGUKlO6v6g0r\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IP0Sdx58coIaCvxlizplm7DkgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: trong khi </strong>nh&oacute;m người dưới 15 tuổi v&agrave; từ 50 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n c&oacute; <strong>xu hướng tăng</strong>, th&igrave; nh&oacute;m từ 16-30 v&agrave; 31-50 <strong>giảm dần</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhaydqfyxoXo3BxQem5lWncGgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>nh&oacute;m<strong> </strong>độ tuổi 16-30 lu&ocirc;n chiếm phần trăm người d&ugrave;ng Internet cao nhất<strong> </strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;n</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GFpVdzjK7oGjp3xQjvolh7WMgMd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong> Nh&oacute;m người từ 16 đến 30 tuổi v&agrave; 31 đến 50 tuổi</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NWtxdrlxookPx7xw0QUlbz1JgAd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDKudNj3gobNdfxV0uplNyMxglg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1998 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m 16-30 chiếm 53%, so với 31-50 l&agrave; 41%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JCacdKB3oo3RG0xFUnElvpvAg6f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 16-30 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>v&agrave; đạt 44% v&agrave;o năm 2000)</em><em><strong> </strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VeZTd56WIoucy6xpmIxlXQTngVc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 31-50 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm dần</strong></em><em> đạt 37% v&agrave;o năm 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LvyndnlVooGFh0xMWf8lVktMgSc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Nh&oacute;m người dưới 15 tuổi v&agrave; từ 50 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQwZd7FArof5V1xpUAbllmYtgSh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VBP5dTNKTor3XZxTesjlhqAhg8D\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1998 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m dưới 15 chỉ chiếm 2%, trong khi nh&oacute;m 50 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n chiếm 4%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XzhZddi5xoYum0x0kNblU5iKgDg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m dưới 15 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>c&oacute; sự tăng nhanh</strong></em><em>, đạt 9% v&agrave;o năm 2000)</em><em><strong> </strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WMOXdTY4boVlxlxXqtlliD4lgKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 50 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n </strong><em>(<strong>tăng nhẹ</strong> đạt 10% v&agrave;o năm 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HeCudyQxnoHeYHxDndElSNPDggK\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q7OWdJkQ4oDeTKxqIEMlELE5gXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt <strong>\"nh&oacute;m người ở độ tuổi n&agrave;o đ&oacute;\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"people aged 16 to 30 \"</strong>, th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để c&acirc;u văn đa dạng hơn nha (lưu &yacute; danh từ số &iacute;t số nhiều)</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EZT5dCWvyomWxgxErtdlS4XSgjd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\"The 16-30 age group\"</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TNdrdXoe1oQhOhxxoHblieDdgwZ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\"The 16-30 age brackets\"</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKq0dP39eoIa3Px3ZnvlZ0t3gdb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\"16-to-30-year-olds\"</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MkzedYVTyoYGYTx6OftlzOfzgCf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PvqKdKp2rofYaFxUyOblLARqg8i\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>The 16-30 age group</strong> consistently accounted for the highest proportion of Internet users over the period shown.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmxbdflTBoLAYxxHeVflrno9gtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>The figures for users within <strong>the 16-30 and 31-50 age brackets</strong> declined gradually.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UVF6dQDUooenb4xzXVPlOpy0gRd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Around 53% of <strong>16-to-30-year-olds</strong> were Internet users</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
