            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZ3Qdrq08oFKMNx3RsBlZpqxgde\">Overall, while Internet usage among those under 15 years old and those aged 50 or above showed an upward trend throughout the period, the figures for users within the 16-30 and 31-50 age brackets declined gradually. Additionally, the 16-30 age group consistently accounted for the highest proportion of Internet users over the period shown.</div>\n</div>",
